            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Euler-Lagrange+equation"} Euler-Lagrange
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equations+of+motion"} equations of motion
            by construction depend on the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lagrangian+density"} Lagrangian density
            only up to a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/total+spacetime+derivative"} total spacetime derivative
            (prop.
            = succeed ")," do
