            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/presymplectic+current"} presymplectic current
            yields the following:
          #LieDerivativeVariational.num_defn
            %h6#definition_7 Definition
            %p
              %strong (variational Lie derivative)
            %p
